 resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, highscores and leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What The First Mine does not offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and violence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stefan B\u00f6ttcher"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2328840/c10d27d5838fff2d6e3fabfe9d8400792be0cf63/header.jpg?t=1755168762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M3 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109657,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie480.mp4?t=1745750258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109657/movie_max.mp4?t